{"seq":5,"slug":"physics","title":"九年级物理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"九年级物理-简介\">九年级物理 简介</h1><p>本 hub 聚焦九年级物理的两大主线——<strong>电学</strong>与<strong>电磁学</strong>，并对初中三年物理做一次<strong>中考导向的综合复习</strong>。九年级是初中物理的收口之年：新知识只剩&quot;电与磁&quot;一块，其余精力都投向把声、光、热、力、电五大板块打通成一张可应试的知识网。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>九年级物理不是孤立的一年，它建立在八年级的物理基础之上，又与同年级其他学科相互支撑。明确边界能避免&quot;在错的地方找知识&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>归属 hub</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>力、运动、压强、浮力、简单机械</td>\n<td>八年级物理·力学</td>\n<td><strong>前置</strong>：本 hub 第三章只做复习与综合计算，原始推导在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光的反射/折射、声现象</td>\n<td>八年级物理·光学与声</td>\n<td><strong>前置</strong>：电磁波一节把光纳入波谱，需回看光学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温度、热量、内能、能量守恒</td>\n<td>八年级物理·热与能</td>\n<td><strong>前置</strong>：焦耳定律、能量复习都建立在热学之上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电荷、电路、欧姆定律、电功率</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub 第一章</strong></td>\n<td>九年级全新核心，中考分值最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁、电磁感应、电磁波</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub 第二章</strong></td>\n<td>九年级全新内容，连接电与磁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声光热力电五板块综合</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub 第三章</strong></td>\n<td>把八、九年级全部物理串成应试网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数、二次函数、统计</td>\n<td>九年级数学</td>\n<td><strong>工具</strong>：物理量关系即函数关系，数据处理即统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金属材料、燃烧、环境</td>\n<td>九年级化学</td>\n<td><strong>跨学科</strong>：磁性材料、能源燃烧的物质视角</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>新知识（电、磁、波）在本 hub，旧知识（力、光、热）的源头在八年级物理，本 hub 第三章只负责把它们综合起来应试。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>第一章 电学（必须按序，不可跳）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"electricity/circuit-basics\">电路基础</a> → 2. <a href=\"electricity/ohms-law\">欧姆定律</a> → 3. <a href=\"electricity/electrical-power\">电功率</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>电学三节是严格递进的：没认清串并联结构无法用欧姆定律，没有欧姆定律推不出电功率公式。这是本 hub 投入产出比最高的部分，务必吃透。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 电磁与波（概念为主）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"magnetism-waves/magnetism\">磁现象</a>（电生磁）→ 2. <a href=\"magnetism-waves/electromagnetic-induction\">电磁感应</a>（磁生电）→ 3. <a href=\"magnetism-waves/electromagnetic-waves\">电磁波</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>这部分计算少、概念多，抓住&quot;电与磁互为逆过程&quot;这条主线即可。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 综合复习（贯穿全程）</strong>\n<a href=\"comprehensive-physics/mechanics-review\">力学复习</a> · <a href=\"comprehensive-physics/energy-review\">能量复习</a> · <a href=\"comprehensive-physics/experiment-skills\">实验技能</a>——不必等学完前两章，可在复习阶段穿插进行，用思维导图把各板块知识关联起来。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分人群建议\">分人群建议</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>跟进新课的学生</strong>：按第一章 → 第二章顺序学，第三章留到学期末复习。</li>\n<li><strong>中考冲刺的学生</strong>：先用第三章三节做全局体检，定位薄弱板块，再回到第一、二章专题突破，电学计算题反复练变形应用。</li>\n<li><strong>基础薄弱、想补漏的学生</strong>：先回八年级物理补齐力/光/热前置（见上表与各篇&quot;延伸阅读&quot;链接），再进电学。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>八年级物理全部内容</strong>：力、运动、压强、浮力、简单机械、光、声、热、能量守恒——尤其是能量守恒，它是理解焦耳定律和发电原理的关键。</li>\n<li><strong>九年级数学</strong>：正比/反比与函数图象（理解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=U/R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=U^2/R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 的量间关系）、列方程解应用题（电学综合计算的基本功）。</li>\n<li><strong>基本实验素养</strong>：会读电表、画电路图、用控制变量法设计探究——这些在第三章实验技能一节会系统强化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本内容适合九年级学生物理中考备考与系统复习使用。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"electricity","title":"电学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"circuit-basics","title":"九年级物理 — 电路基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity/circuit-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ohms-law","title":"九年级物理 — 欧姆定律","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity/ohms-law"},{"seq":3,"slug":"electrical-power","title":"九年级物理 — 电功率","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity/electrical-power"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"magnetism-waves","title":"磁学与波","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/magnetism-waves","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"magnetism","title":"九年级物理 — 磁现象","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/magnetism-waves/magnetism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"electromagnetic-induction","title":"九年级物理 — 电磁感应","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/magnetism-waves/electromagnetic-induction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"electromagnetic-waves","title":"九年级物理 — 电磁波","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/magnetism-waves/electromagnetic-waves"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"comprehensive-physics","title":"综合物理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/comprehensive-physics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mechanics-review","title":"九年级物理 — 力学复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/comprehensive-physics/mechanics-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"energy-review","title":"九年级物理 — 能量复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/comprehensive-physics/energy-review"},{"seq":3,"slug":"experiment-skills","title":"九年级物理 — 实验技能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/comprehensive-physics/experiment-skills"}]}]}